  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Identifying the Setup**\n\nI\'ve discovered the `package.json` lacks a custom server script for development; it defaults to a client-side SPA setup using Vite. Currently, the dev script executes `vite --port=3000 --host=0.0.0.0`. I\'m now assessing the user\'s intent within this configuration.\n\n\n**Confirming Project Scope**\n\nOkay, I\'ve confirmed the user prefers a client-side SPA by default, unless otherwise specified. I\'m focusing now on building a SPA matching the user\'s provided image/HTML, prioritizing high-fidelity design. I\'m taking the user\'s explicit request as a starting point. I\'m planning out the \"Monitoreo de usuarios\" page now, which will showcase a real-time agent status tracker with interactive elements for active calls and chats.\n\n\n**Defining Dashboard Features**\n\nI\'m now outlining key functionalities for a supervisor dashboard. I\'m prioritizing features found in real-world applications. The design will include: a call/chat simulator for status changes, a real-time queue viewer with metrics and interactive charts, a recordings section with search and playback controls, and a quality assurance module with evaluation forms and scoring.\n\n\n**Evaluating Library Choices**\n\nI\'m now determining the optimal libraries for data visualization within the supervisor dashboard\'s queue viewer. After considering custom SVG charts for animation, I\'ve decided to install and use `recharts` for its ease of use and professional rendering. I\'ve also verified available packages. I\'m taking this into account while proceeding with the design.\n\n\n"
